entures in the aggregate principal amount of $55,000,000 towards the cost of certain capital works of the Corporation of the City of London;", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "it being noted that the Corporate Services Committee heard a verbal presentation from K. Yeung (CIBC), with respect to this matter.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "Motion Passed (5 to 0)", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [], "__class__": "Motion"}], "items": {}, "datetime": "2018-03-05 15:30:00", "attachments": [{"empty_flag": false, "title": "2018-03-05 Staff Report - 2018 Debenture Issuance Update", "url": "https://pub-london.escribemeetings.com/filestream.ashx?DocumentId=37922", "date": "2018-03-05 00:00:00", "local_page": null, "__class__": "Attachment"}], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}}, "datetime": "2018-03-05 15:30:00", "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "3": {"title": "Scheduled Items", "number": "3", "content": [{"string": "None.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "items": {}, "datetime": "2018-03-05 15:30:00", "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "4": {"title": "Items for Direction", "number": "4", "content": [{"string": "None.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "items": {}, "datetime": "2018-03-05 15:30:00", "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "5": {"title": "Deferred Matters/Additional Business", "number": "5", "content": [{"string": "None.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "items": {}, "datetime": "2018-03-05 15:30:00", "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "6": {"title": "Adjournment", "number": "6", "content": [{"pre_motion_texts": [], "moved_by": {"string": "Moved by P. Hubert", "__class__": "Mover"}, "seconded_by": {"string": "Seconded by J. Morgan", "__class__": "Mover"}, "motion_texts": [{"string": "That the meeting adjourn.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [], "__cla